cond confirmation run would strengthen. Let me do a second run to confirm reproducibility, and in parallel prepare zip.\n\nActually the user said \"пр и комит и продолжай\" — continue the work. The main remaining bits:\n1. Confirm reproducibility (2nd run).\n2. Package final deliverables (zip).\n3. Possibly also update the e2e? The repo's e2e.py has hardcoded /home/user paths — not our task.\n\nLet me run the pure-patch run once more to confirm stability, then zip everything.", "time": {"start": 1793036601280, "end": 1793036613783}, "id": "prt_1794f47c00017TuHbHdzJu88lb", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1794f3f33001BYZYZvRPGyeNq2"}, {"type": "text", "text": "PR обновлён. Продолжаю: подтверждаю воспроизводимость PASS вторым прогоном и собираю итоговый артефакт.", "time": {"start": 1793036613786, "end": 1793036617222}, "id": "prt_1794f789a001d3RKmlWZLN5vF6", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1794f3f33001BYZYZvRPGyeNq2"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_fc52c629b27542178d257c45", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/tmp && python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('cover-pure-patch.json'))\nprint('pass:', d.get('pass'))\nprint('wordFixes:', d.get('wordFixes'))\nprint('engine:', d.get('engine'))\nfor c in d['checks']: print(' ', c)\nPY\nsetsid python3 run_pure_patch.py < /dev/null > pure-patch4.log 2>&1 & disown; echo launched-confirmation", "timeout": 15000}, "output": "pass: True\nwordFixes: None\nengine: {'ok': True, 'engine': 'ready', 'dict': 519, 'words': 250000}\n  {'name': 'Как прожить', 'ok': True}\n  {'name': 'жизнь, будучи старшей', 'ok': True}\n  {'name': 'сестрой тирана', 'ok': True}\n  {'name': 'УЖЕ ПОРА НАЧИНАТЬ ВСТРЕЧУ', 'ok': True}\n  {'name': 'ПРИБЫЛА', 'ok': True}\n  {'name': 'В БУДУЩЕМ', 'ok': True}\nlaunched-confirmation\n", "metadata": {"output": "pass: True\nwordFixes: None\nengine: {'ok': True, 'engine': 're