e/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 128421, "input": 679, "output": 662, "reasoning": 104, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 126976}}, "modelID": "mimo-v2.6-flash-free", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1793036751016, "completed": 1793036821449}, "finish": "stop", "id": "msg_1795190a8001ltti6N1cVDD2qY", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "a77a95e5b6ed5e78c64d830749b6af597f3be05b", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_179525923001203oqLCq7ro7qg", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795190a8001ltti6N1cVDD2qY"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "Let me also check if there are any repo tests/checks I should run (check.py, run_all.sh) — but earlier analysis showed they reference non-existent paths. Let me quickly verify the changed file has no syntax issues by loading it in node or the page (already done via the runs). The runs themselves validated it.\n\nAlso, should I run check.py? It was said to be non-functional (missing part files). Skip.\n\nFinal summary for the user. Also mention PR link, commits, artifacts.", "time": {"start": 1793036802342, "end": 1793036806155}, "id": "prt_179525926001c7aXcVBzbOwUlF", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795190a8001ltti6N1cVDD2qY"}, {"type": "text", "text": "Готово.\n\n## Итог\n\n**Задача выполнена:** «будучи» читается без `wordFixes` — точным перебором обрезки и подготовки кропа, без подмены слова.\n\n**PR:** https://github.com/sj0404-collab/yomikai-web/pull/2 (ветка `fix/title-line-crop`, 2 коммита)\n\n**Что было сделано:**\n1. **Перебор** (`tmp/brute_core.js` + `run_brute.py` + `brute_official_box.py`): 8563 варианта — обрезка кропа со всех сторон (сужение/расширение по каждой стороне), поля, масштаб ×1.5/2/3, яркость, контраст, гамма, 6 бинаризаций + пословно/побуквенно. На боксе строки из официального полосового прогона лучший вариант без подмены: **кроп вверх на 30 % высоты строки + поля 15 % → «жизнь, будучи старшей», conf 0.74**.\n2. **Патч `decodeLine`**: при незнакомых словах в широкой строке пробует 3 расширения кропа × 6 подготовок, берёт лучший по `textScore`.\n3. **Патч `textScore`**: словарное слово 10 очков, `isPlausible`-форма 4, мусор −12 — иначе «будучию» (тоже plausible) побеждало «будучи» при равном счёте.\n\n**Проверка (полосовой режим 412×800, без wordFixes), 2 прогона подряд — PASS:**\n```\n1. Как прожить жизнь, будучи старшей сестрой тирана\n2. УЖЕ ПОРА НАЧИНАТЬ ВСТРЕЧУ, ТАК ЧТО ЕЁ ВЫСОЧЕСТВО, ДОЛЖНО БЫТЬ, ПРИБЫЛА.\n3. НЕ УВЕРЕН, КАК СТОИТ СКАЗАТЬ ЭТО, НО...\n4. В БУДУЩЕМ, КОГДА ВЫ БУДЕТЕ ГОВОРИТЬ С ЕЁ ВЫСОЧЕСТВОМ\n```\n6/6 проверок, ~80 с, 296 кропов.\n\n**Артефакты:** `tmp/cover-pure-no-wordfixes.zip` (скриншоты `shots_pure/`, отчёты, логи перебора), отчёт `tmp/cover-pure-patch.json`.", "time": {"start": 1793036806157, "end": 1793036821396}, "id": "prt_17952680d001uTTXlijgE6586m", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795190a8001ltti6N1cVDD2qY"}, {"reason": "stop", "snapshot": "a77a95e5b6ed5e78c64d830749b6af597f3be05b", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 128421, "input": 679, "output": 662, "reasoning": 104, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 126976}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_17952a3bb001aWgt6M7lPMuIMK", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795190a8001ltti6N1cVDD2qY"}]}, {"info": {"role": "user", "time": {"created": 1793037046757}, "agent": "build", "model": {"providerID": "opencode", "modelID": "mimo-v2.6-flash-free"}, "summary": {"diffs": []}, "id": "msg_1795613e5001EpPzsEUAJPtRZK", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU"}, "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "встрой в html и отправь на гитхаб и сюда я скачаю и протестирую на телефоне", "id": "prt_1795613e6001qL2oV6mw354nBV", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795613e5001EpPzsEUAJPtRZK"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_1795613e5001EpPzsEUAJPtRZK", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 128972, "input": 839, "output": 84, "reasoning": 433, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 127616}}, "modelID": "mimo-v2.6-flash-free", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1793037046945, "completed": 1793037064516}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_1795614a100175F0vC1mXtONgF", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "a77a95e5b6ed5e78c64d830749b6af597f3be05b", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_17956238a001B0EikRoq7ts2Wq", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795614a100175F0vC1mXtONgF"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "The user wants the patched koma-web.html built/embedded and pushed to GitHub so they can download and test on their phone. The repo's build is non-reproducible (part files missing), but koma-web.html is the single self-contained source. The patch is already in koma-web.html on the branch fix/title-line-crop.\n\nThey want a downloadable file. Options:\n1. The koma-web.html itself is self-contained (models fetched from GitHub? Let me check how models load — they're in IndexedDB, loaded from where?). For phone testing, they likely open koma-web.html and it needs models. Let me check how the app fetches models - earlier the harness put them into IndexedDB manually. On phone, the app probably fetches models from somewhere (GitHub raw?).\n\nLet me check the model loading in koma-web.html.\n\nAlso \"встрой в html\" — maybe they mean embed the models into the html? Or just make sure the patched html is ready. The repo already has koma-web.html with the fix on the branch. Perhaps they want:\n- merge to main? Or keep branch- attach the built html as a release artifact / to the zip\n\n\"отправь на гитхаб и сюда я скачаю\" — \"сюда\" = to the tmp folder (files tab). So: put the final koma-web.html into /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/tmp (visible via Files tab) and push to GitHub.\n\nAlso maybe create a GitHub release with the file for easy download on phone. Let me check how models are loaded on the phone — if the html fetches models from GitHub raw of this repo, then pushing to branch might be enough but the default branch is main. Maybe merge PR to main so the phone fetches fixed version? Careful: merging a PR is a bigger action; user said \"отправь на гитхаб\" — push. They asked to test on phone, so probably download the html file directly.\n\nLet me check model loading paths in koma-web.html.", "time": {"start": 1793037050765, "end": 1793037062767}, "id": "prt_17956238d001UigHwX2HFf7nEe", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795614a100175F0vC1mXtONgF"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_33e6ae9076924bfa9783f173", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code && grep -n \"model:det\\|models/\\|fetch(\\|raw.githubusercontent\\|OCR.loadModels\" koma-web.html | head -30; echo ===; ls -la koma-web.html; wc -c koma-web.html"}, "output": "...output truncated...\n\nFull output saved to: /home/runner/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_179565903001uFsZsMkzSaMdyH\n\n(a.data.type){case\"init-wasm\":yn=!1,a.data.err?(Lo=!0,pa[1](a.data.err)):(Do=!0,pa[0]());break;case\"init-ep\":case\"copy-from\":case\"create\":case\"release\":case\"run\":case\"end-profiling\":{let t=da.get(a.data.type);a.data.err?t.shift()[1](a.data.err):t.shift()[0](a.data.out);break}default:}},Eo=typeof document<\"u\"?document?.currentScript?.src:void 0,ad=async()=>{if(!Do){if(yn)throw new Error(\"multiple calls to 'initWasm()' detected.\");if(Lo)throw new Error(\"previous call to 'initWasm()' failed.\");if(yn=!0,Ir())return Z.wasm.wasmPaths===void 0&&Eo&&Eo.indexOf(\"blob:\")!==0&&(Z.wasm.wasmPaths=Eo.substr(0,+Eo.lastIndexOf(\"/\")+1)),new Promise((a,t)=>{gt?.terminate();let o=URL.createObjectURL(new Blo