HTML embedded (\"встрой в html\") and pushed to GitHub so they can download and test on the phone. The koma-web.html is already self-contained (10MB - contains onnxruntime embedded). Models are loaded via IndexedDB - they import detection.onnx/cyrillic.onnx via file picker (sheetModels at line 5150). Let me check how models get onto the phone — the user probably imports .onnx files through the UI.\n\nSo the deliverable:\n1. The patched koma-web.html is already committed on the branch fix/title-line-crop.\n2. Create a release or just push — the user wants to download it. Best: create a GitHub release with koma-web.html attached, or attach to the tmp folder (\"здесь я скачаю\" — вкладка «Файлы» in the hub). Also copy koma-web.html to /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/tmp so they can download from the Files tab.\n\n\"встрой в html\" — maybe they mean embed the models into the html? Let me check how models load: sheetModels import - user picks files. But maybe there's a fetch from somewhere? Line 5781 mentions \"нужна сеть для onnxruntime-web\" — onnxruntime is embedded in the HTML itself (the big blob above). Models are imported via UI file picker.\n\nActually \"встрой\" might mean: make sure the fix is inside the html (already done) and ship the html. Let me also check if there's a build step that creates a distributable — build.sh references part files that don't exist. The koma-web.html IS the distributable.\n\nPlan:\n1. Copy koma-web.html to /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/tmp/koma-web-patch-buduchi.html (and maybe also the models for convenience).\n2. Create a GitHub release on the branch/repo with the html attached (gh release create), so the user can download from GitHub too.\n3. Maybe also merge PR? User said \"отправь на гитхаб\" — the PR is already on GitHub. Creating a release makes it downloadable. Let me create a release from the branch with assets.\n\nAlso include models in the release so the phone test is easy? The app needs: koma-web.html + import models via UI (detection.onnx, cyrillic.onnx, cyrillic.txt?). Let me check what the model import expects - line 5150: detection.onnx, presumably also rec onnx and dict. Let me look at the import function quickly.", "time": {"start": 1793037068233, "end": 1793037080580}, "id": "prt_1795667c9001WN1wr0eAXwTLC8", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795659a3001rGiT7S6olX7C0o"}, {"type": "tool", "tool": "bash", "callID": "call_ac74d511e5b84463882dde47", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"command": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code && sed -n '5135,5180p' koma-web.html"}, "output": "  } catch (e) {\n    toast('Движок не считает: ' + (e.message || e), 8000);\n    OCR.engine = 'failed'; OCR.reason = String(e.message || e); await renderModels();\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * Принять любое количество выбранных файлов модели. Ключевое: шторку не\n * закрываем, разбираем по именам, показываем, чего ещё не хватает.\n */\nasync function storeModelFiles(files) {\n  if (!files || !files.length) return;\n  const saved = [];\n  for (const f of files) {\n    const n = f.name.toLowerCase();\n    if (n === 'detection.onnx') { await DB.put('kv', { k: 'model:det', v: await f.arrayBuffer() }); saved.push('detection.onnx'); }\n    else if (n === 'cyrillic.onnx') { await DB.put('kv', { k: 'model:rec', v: await f.arrayBuffer() }); saved.push('cyrillic.onnx'); }\n    else if (n === 'cyrillic.txt') { await DB.put('kv', { k: 'model:dict', v: await f.text() }); saved.push('cyrillic.txt'); }\n  }\n  if (!saved.length) {\n    await renderModels();\n    toast('Нужны файлы detection.onnx, cyrillic.onnx, cyrillic.txt — по именам. Выбрано: '\n      + Array.from(files).map(f => f.name).join(', '), 6000);\n    return;\n  }\n  await renderModels();\n  const det = await DB.get('kv', 'model:det');\n  const rec = await DB.get('kv', 'model:rec');\n  const dict = await DB.get('kv', 'model:dict');\n  const missing = [!det && 'detection.onnx', !rec && 'cyrillic.onnx', !dict && 'cyrillic.txt'].filter(Boolean);\n  toast('Принято: ' + saved.join(', ') + (missing.length ? ' · ещё нужно: ' + missing.join(', ') : ''), 5000);\n  if (!missing.length) {\n    try {\n      const ok = await OCR.loadModels();\n      toast(ok ? 'Все три модели на месте, движок готов'\n               : 'Модели сохранены. ' + OCR.statusText() + (OCR.reason ? ': ' + OCR.reason : ''), 9000);\n    } catch (e) {\n      OCR.engine = 'failed'; OCR.reason = String(e.message || e);\n      toast('Движок не поднялся: ' + OCR.reason, 8000);\n    }\n    await renderModels();\n    if (typeof selfCheck === 'function') await selfCheck();\n  }\n}\n\n/* Совместимость: старый вход выбора моделей ведёт на общий разбор файлов,\n", "metadata": {"output": "  } catch (e) {\n    toast('Движок не считает: ' + (e.message || e), 8000);\n    OCR.engine = 'failed'; OCR.reason = String(e.message || e); await renderModels();\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * Принять любое количество выбранных файлов модели. Ключевое: шторку не\n * закрываем, разбираем по именам, показываем, чего ещё не хватает.\n */\nasync function storeModelFiles(files) {\n  if (!files || !files.length) return;\n  const saved = [];\n  for (const f of files) {\n    const n = f.name.toLowerCase();\n    if (n === 'detection.onnx') { await DB.put('kv', { k: 'model:det', v: await f.arrayBuffer() }); saved.push('detection.onnx'); }\n    else if (n === 'cyrillic.onnx') { await DB.put('kv', { k: 'model:rec', v: await f.arrayBuffer() }); saved.push('cyrillic.onnx'); }\n    else if (n === 'cyrillic.txt') { await DB.put('kv', { k: 'model:dict', v: await f.text() }); saved.push('cyrillic.txt'); }\n  }\n  if (!saved.length) {\n    await renderModels();\n    toast('Нужны файлы detection.onnx, cyrillic.onnx, cyrillic.txt — по именам. Выбрано: '\n      + Array.from(files).map(f => f.name).join(', '), 6000);\n    return;\n  }\n  await renderModels();\n  const det = await DB.get('kv', 'model:det');\n  const rec = await DB.get('kv', 'model:rec');\n  const dict = await DB.get('kv', 'model:dict');\n  const missing = [!det && 'detection.onnx', !rec && 'cyrillic.onnx', !dict && 'cyrillic.txt'].filter(Boolean);\n  toast('Принято: ' + saved.join(', ') + (missing.length ? ' · ещё нужно: ' + missing.join(', ') : ''), 5000);\n  if (!missing.length) {\n    try {\n      const ok = await OCR.loadModels();\n      toast(ok ? 'Все три модели на месте, движок готов'\n               : 'Модели сохранены. ' + OCR.statusText() + (OCR.reason ? ': ' + OCR.reason : ''), 9000);\n    } catch (e) {\n      OCR.engine = 'failed'; OCR.reason = String(e.message || e);\n      toast('Движок не поднялся: ' + OCR.reason, 8000);\n    }\n    await renderModels();\n    if (typeof selfCheck === 'function') await selfCheck();\n  }\n}\n\n/* Совместимость: старый вход выбора моделей ведёт на общий разбор файлов,\n", "exit": 0, "truncated": false}, "title": "cd /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code && sed -n '5135,5180p' koma-web.html", "time": {"start": 1793037082038, "end": 1793037082059}}, "id": "prt_179569807001S5cdK10HoJDpKC", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795659a3001rGiT7S6olX7C0o"}, {"reason": "tool-calls", "snapshot": "a77a95e5b6ed5e78c64d830749b6af597f3be05b", "type": "step-finish", "tokens": {"total": 131753, "input": 2701, "output": 52, "reasoning": 552, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 128448}}, "cost": 0, "id": "prt_179569dde001fvfb3VrCyMJbtq", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_1795659a3001rGiT7S6olX7C0o"}]}, {"info": {"parentID": "msg_1795613e5001EpPzsEUAJPtRZK", "role": "assistant", "mode": "build", "agent": "build", "path": {"cwd": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code", "root": "/home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/code"}, "cost": 0, "tokens": {"total": 133346, "input": 1268, "output": 81, "reasoning": 861, "cache": {"write": 0, "read": 131136}}, "modelID": "mimo-v2.6-flash-free", "providerID": "opencode", "time": {"created": 1793037082217, "completed": 1793037114132}, "finish": "tool-calls", "id": "msg_179569e69001FuBdz89FwiD7vm", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU"}, "parts": [{"snapshot": "a77a95e5b6ed5e78c64d830749b6af597f3be05b", "type": "step-start", "id": "prt_17956a9120017WLsguj07HaqRC", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_179569e69001FuBdz89FwiD7vm"}, {"type": "reasoning", "text": "The user wants: embed the fix into the HTML (already done in koma-web.html on branch fix/title-line-crop), push to GitHub (already pushed), and also put a downloadable copy \"сюда\" (in tmp for the Files tab). They'll download and test on phone.\n\nBut \"встрой в html\" — maybe they mean the built HTML with models embedded? Let me check: koma-web.html is 10MB — does it already contain onnxruntime-web embedded (the minified ort code we saw in grep output suggests yes). Models (detection.onnx, cyrillic.onnx) are stored via IndexedDB from files the user imports through the Models sheet. So for phone testing, the user needs koma-web.html + the 3 model files.\n\nLet me check if the repo has a built distributable, or if koma-web.html is the app itself. It's 10MB with embedded onnxruntime. Models are separate files imported by the user.\n\nSo deliverables:\n1. koma-web.html (patched, on GitHub branch — already pushed; maybe also merge to main? User said \"отправь на гитхаб\" — the PR is up. But for easy download, maybe they want a release or the file directly. I could create a GitHub release with the html + models attached.)\n2. Copy to /home/runner/hub-work/yomikai-web/tmp for the Files tab download.\n\nLet me also check whether main branch should get the merge — user previously was told about PR. \"отправь на гитхаб и сюда я скачаю\" — put it on GitHub (done via PR; but for direct download maybe create a release) and copy here (tmp folder).\n\nPlan:\n1. Copy patched koma-web.html → tmp/koma-web-buduchi.html (and maybe models too for phone testing).\n2. Create a zip with html + models for phone: koma-web-phone.zip.\n3. Create GitHub release (tag) on the branch or after merging, attach zip so user can download from GitHub on the phone directly.\n\nShould I merge the PR? User said \"отправь на гитхаб\" — ambiguous, but merging to main makes the release easier and is what they likely want (\"пр и комит\" earlier = PR and commit; now \"отправь на гитхаб\" likely means make it available). Creating a release from the branch is fine without merging. But maybe merging is better since user will test and then decide. I'll create a release with the assets from the current branch, without merging the PR (leave that to them). Actually, to download on a phone, a release asset URL is ideal.\n\nLet me build the phone bundle:\n- koma-web.html (patched)\n- models: detection.onnx, cyrillic.onnx, cyrillic.txt (needed to import via the app's Models sheet)\n\nCheck if cyrillic.txt is needed (dict embed — README said \"вшитый словарь\"? Earlier run loaded dict via DB from cyrillic.txt file). The app's storeModelFiles requires all three. So include all three.\n\nAlso, the app needs onnxruntime-web — is it embedded in the html? The 10MB html contains the minified ort code (we saw it in grep). Yes, embedded.\n\nSteps:\n1. mkdir tmp/phone — copy koma-web.html renamed, models.\n2. zip → tmp/koma-web-buduchi-phone.zip\n3. Copy also plain koma-web.html to tmp for direct download.\n4. gh release create (on the repo, target branch fix/title-line-crop or main?) with the zip attached.\n5. Tell user URLs.\n\nAlso push already done. Maybe also merge PR into main so raw.githubusercontent main has it? Let me not merge without confirmation — but user said \"отправь на гитхаб\" after PR was already created... They may want it merged so they can grab raw file. A release works regardless. I'll create the release from the current head of fix/title-line-crop.\n\nLet me do it.", "time": {"start": 1793037084949, "end": 1793037112132}, "id": "prt_17956a9140018A4IDzvtOGmFdQ", "sessionID": "ses_e870b7496ffeoaBu30bGkMD4sU", "messageID": "msg_17